module bankr-oke-local-rules.local-rules

import core.frcp6.{ frcp6 }
import frbp.events.{ PetitionFiled }

// The Bankr. E.D. Okla. court's own periods, counted under FRBP 9006(a).
// The FRBP periods are lit/frbp's and are not declared again: payment
// advices and supplemental schedules within 14 days (LBR 1007-1), the
// schedule of post-petition debts after conversion (LBR 1019-1), the
// chapter 13 plan (LBR 3015-1), reaffirmation agreements 60 days after the
// first meeting date (LBR 4008-1), service of the summons within 7 days
// (LBR 7004-2), the jury demand (LBR 9015-1(B), (C)), and the appeal
// designations, transcript order, briefs, election and dismissal periods
// (LBR 8001-1 through 8009-1). The Code's are not declared either: the
// statement of intention (LBR 1007-2, § 521(a)(2)), the tax return 7 days
// before the § 341 meeting (LBR 2003-1, § 521(e)(2)(A)), the chapter 12
// plan within 90 days (LBR 3015-1, § 1221), chapter 13 payments within 30
// days (LBR 3070-1, § 1326(a)(1)) and the 30-day stay hearing (LBR 4001-1).
// Every value below binds only to the CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED printable rules,
// so each cite is a hole. Stated in the rules but not declared: the bar
// date or 30 days after notice to an added creditor, whichever is later
// (LBR 3003-1); the pre-confirmation tax certification within 14 days
// before confirmation (LBR 3015-3(B)), a window; depositions after 7 days
// from a stay relief motion (LBR 4001-1(E)), a floor; the transcript
// redaction periods (LBR 5003-1), the Judicial Conference's; the
// debtor-in-possession's report duties on conversion and dismissal (LBR
// 1017-1, 1017-2); and the time to consent to a bankruptcy judge's jury
// trial, stated as 30 days after the initial demand (LBR 9015-1(F)) and as
// 14 days after the last date for a timely demand (LBR 9015-1(H)), which
// conflict. The page limits are stated but not declared, because a limit
// takes a verified citation and these are holes: an adversary brief or
// brief in opposition and a summary judgment brief or response not more
// than twenty pages, and a reply brief not more than ten, exclusive of
// attachments (LBR 7007-1(B), 7056-1(A)-(C)). The outline's Supreme Court
// decisions construe the Code and the FRBP, not these rules, and are
// removed here: no reporter text is vendored.
/// A creditor is appointed to a committee (E.D. Okla. LBR 2003-2).
event CommitteeAppointed()
/// The debtor serves the claims bar date notice on a creditor added by
/// amended schedules (E.D. Okla. LBR 3003-1).
event BarDateNoticeServed()
/// The hearing on confirmation of a plan (E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-2, 3015-6,
/// 3020-1(C)).
event ConfirmationHearing()
/// The notice of a confirmation hearing is entered (E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-5,
/// 3020-1(B)).
event ConfirmationHearingNoticed()
/// A confirmation notice and plan, or a disclosure statement, is mailed
/// (E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-5, 3016-1(A), 3020-1(B)).
event NoticeMailed()
/// A chapter 11 disclosure statement is filed (E.D. Okla. LBR 3016-1(A)).
event DisclosureStatementFiled()
/// A chapter 11 plan is confirmed (E.D. Okla. LBR 3022-1).
event PlanConfirmed()
/// A chapter 11 plan is substantially consummated under 11 U.S.C. § 1101(2)
/// (E.D. Okla. LBR 3022-1).
event PlanSubstantiallyConsummated()
/// Written discovery requests on a motion for relief from stay are served
/// (E.D. Okla. LBR 4001-1(E)).
event StayDiscoveryServed()
/// A party in interest files a request under 11 U.S.C. § 521(f) that the
/// debtor file tax returns (E.D. Okla. LBR 4002-1(C)).
event TaxReturnRequestFiled()
/// An individual chapter 11 debtor or a chapter 12 or 13 trustee files
/// notice that all plan payments have been paid (E.D. Okla. LBR 4004-1(A)).
event PlanCompletionNoticeFiled()
/// The date set in a notice for a proposed use, sale or lease of property
/// (E.D. Okla. LBR 6004-1).
event ProposedActionDate()
/// A motion, application or objection with its brief is filed in an
/// adversary proceeding (E.D. Okla. LBR 7007-1(B)).
event AdversaryMotionFiled()
/// A brief in opposition is filed in an adversary proceeding (E.D. Okla.
/// LBR 7007-1(B)).
event OppositionBriefFiled()
/// The scheduling conference in an adversary proceeding (E.D. Okla. LBR
/// 7016-1(A)).
event SchedulingConference()
/// The pretrial conference in an adversary proceeding (E.D. Okla. LBR
/// 7016-1).
event PretrialConference()
/// The trial of an adversary proceeding (E.D. Okla. LBR 7016-1(B)).
event TrialDate()
/// The brief in support of a motion for summary judgment is filed (E.D.
/// Okla. LBR 7056-1(B)).
event SummaryJudgmentBriefFiled()
/// The response brief to a motion for summary judgment is filed (E.D. Okla.
/// LBR 7056-1(C)).
event SummaryJudgmentResponseFiled()
/// The date set for a hearing (E.D. Okla. LBR 9006-1(C)).
event HearingDate()
/// A motion with its Notice of Opportunity for Hearing (Form 20A) is
/// entered on the docket (E.D. Okla. LBR 9013-1).
event MotionDocketed()
/// The jury trial setting (E.D. Okla. LBR 9015-1(G)).
event JuryTrialSetting()
/// An evidentiary hearing (E.D. Okla. LBR 9017-1, 9017-2).
event EvidentiaryHearing()
/// A compromise or settlement is entered in the bankruptcy case (E.D. Okla.
/// LBR 9019-1).
event CompromiseApproved()
/// A settlement conference (E.D. Okla. LBR 9019-2).
event SettlementConference()

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 1007-1: a pro se debtor who cannot fully complete the Pro
/// Se Disclosure form when the petition is filed files it as fully as
/// possible and files an Amended Pro Se Disclosure within seven days.
deadline amended-pro-se-disclosure-period: 7.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 1007-1, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 2003-2: a corporate committee member's ownership
/// statement is filed within fourteen days of its appointment to the
/// committee.
deadline committee-ownership-statement-period: 14.days after CommitteeAppointed() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 2003-2, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3003-1: the debtor files a certificate of mailing within
/// two days after serving the bar date notice on a creditor added after the
/// bar date notice.
deadline added-creditor-mailing-certificate-period: 2.days after BarDateNoticeServed() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3003-1, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-2: an amended chapter 12 or 13 plan, with Local Form
/// 420C-1, is mailed to the matrix, the United States trustee and the
/// trustee twenty-eight days prior to the confirmation hearing.
deadline amended-plan-mailing-period: 28.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-2, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-5: the clerk, or the debtor in possession if the
/// court directs, mails the chapter 12 confirmation notice and plan to the
/// matrix within seven days of entry of the notice.
deadline chapter-12-notice-mailing-period: 7.days after ConfirmationHearingNoticed() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-5, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-5: proof of service of a mailed confirmation notice,
/// or a certificate of mailing of a disclosure statement (LBR 3016-1(A),
/// 3020-1(B)), is filed within two days of the mailing.
deadline notice-mailing-proof-period: 2.days after NoticeMailed() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-5, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-6: objections to a chapter 12 or 13 plan are filed
/// no later than seven days prior to the confirmation hearing; untimely
/// objections may be disregarded.
deadline chapter-12-13-plan-objection-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3015-6, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3016-1(A): the proponent mails the disclosure statement
/// as FRBP 3017(a) requires within three days of filing.
deadline disclosure-statement-mailing-period: 3.days after DisclosureStatementFiled() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3016-1(A), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3020-1(B): the plan proponent mails the notice, plan,
/// ballot and approved disclosure statement under FRBP 3017(d) within three
/// days of entry of the notice of confirmation hearing.
deadline chapter-11-confirmation-mailing-period: 3.days after ConfirmationHearingNoticed() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3020-1(B), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3020-1(C): objections to confirmation of a chapter 11
/// plan are filed at least fourteen days before the confirmation hearing
/// unless the court shortens notice or in a small business case.
deadline chapter-11-confirmation-objection-period: 14.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3020-1(C), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3022-1: the plan proponent files the Chapter 11 Final
/// Report and Application for Final Decree within six months after
/// confirmation or within thirty days after substantial consummation,
/// whichever is earlier.
deadline final-report-period: 6.months after PlanConfirmed() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3022-1, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 3022-1: the plan proponent files the Final Report within
/// thirty days after substantial consummation under § 1101(2), if earlier
/// than six months after confirmation.
deadline final-report-consummation-period: 30.days after PlanSubstantiallyConsummated() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 3022-1, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 4001-1(E): responses to discovery requests on a motion
/// for relief from stay are due in 14 days from service of the written
/// requests.
deadline stay-discovery-response-period: 14.days after StayDiscoveryServed() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 4001-1(E), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 4002-1(C): within seven days of the filing of a § 521(f)
/// request, the debtor redacts and files the tax returns as a secure event.
deadline tax-return-filing-period: 7.days after TaxReturnRequestFiled() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 4002-1(C), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 4004-1(A): within twenty-one days following the notice
/// that all plan payments are paid, the debtor files a statement whether 11
/// U.S.C. § 522(q) applies.
deadline section-522q-statement-period: 21.days after PlanCompletionNoticeFiled() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 4004-1(A), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 6004-1: objections to a proposed use, sale or lease
/// outside the ordinary course must be filed and served not less than seven
/// days before the date set for the proposed action.
deadline sale-objection-period: 7.days before ProposedActionDate() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 6004-1, undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 7007-1(B): a brief in opposition, if filed, is filed
/// within fourteen days after the filing of the original motion,
/// application or objection.
deadline adversary-opposition-brief-period: 14.days after AdversaryMotionFiled() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 7007-1(B), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 7007-1(B): a reply brief, if filed, is filed within
/// fourteen days after filing of the brief in opposition.
deadline adversary-reply-brief-period: 14.days after OppositionBriefFiled() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 7007-1(B), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
}

/// E.D. Okla. LBR 7016-1(A): fourteen days after the scheduling conference,
/// counsel exchange preliminary witness and exhibit lists.
deadline preliminary-lists-period: 14.days after SchedulingConference() counted_by frcp6 cite ?("E.D. Okla. LBR 7016-1(A), undated printable rules 'effective as of December 1, 2009' as later amended: CURRENCY UNCONFIRMED (no edition date on the document or the court's page); the value is the vendored text, unverified")
{
  forum frcp
